<title>CHINA: ALPHA GENERAL DEBUTS AT HK$1.20/SHARE.</title>
<headline>ALPHA GENERAL DEBUTS AT HK$1.20/SHARE.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of appliance distributor Alpha General (Holdings) Ltd made their trading debut at HK$1.20 per share on Thursday, compared with their issue price of HK$1.00 each.  </p>
<p>Alpha General offered 80.9 million new shares at HK$1.00 each, attached with warrants in the proportion of one warrant for every five shares subscribed. The public offer was 41 times subscribed.</p>
<p>The company is engaged in importing, distributing and servicing &quot;General&quot; brand air-conditioners, refrigerators and washing machines in Hong Kong, Macau and China.</p>
<p>It said it would use the net proceeds to enhance its penetration of China's markets.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
